 "guider"}, {"name": "sampler", "link": 255, "label": "sampler", "type": "SAMPLER", "localized_name": "sampler"}, {"name": "sigmas", "link": 256, "label": "sigmas", "type": "SIGMAS", "localized_name": "sigmas"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 271, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}], "flags": {}, "id": 125, "type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SamplerCustomAdvanced"}, "order": 31}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [327], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [" 角色愤怒的说话：哈哈哈！魔头，三百年前你侮辱了我，夺走了我的清白之身，杀光我全家，诛了我的九族。从那刻起，我恨不得吃你肉，喝你的血！今天，我要让你生不如死！！\n\n\n\nsubject_definitions:\n<Audio 1> is used strictly as a voice-timbre and vocal-identity reference forspeaker (S1). Only intrinsic vocal characteristics are retained, including vocal color, resonance, stable pitch character, and vocal texture. The source speaking rate, sentence duration, pause timing, rhythm, cadence, phrasing, prosodic timing, emphasis pattern, breath timing, and emotional pacing are explicitly excluded from reference transfer and must be regenerated from the target dialogue instructions.\n\n\n "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "link": 322, "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 180], "pos": [-1500, 6000], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["\n\n示例（需要再调整下例子）：\n0-3 秒：全景，女子（@图片1）从画面左侧缓步走入樱花庭院（@图片2），背景虚化，没有对白，只有脚步声。\n3-8 秒：切镜到女子（@图片1）的中景，她拔出长剑（@图片3），缓缓起势，樱花瓣从树上飘落。镜头推进。\n8-12 秒：切镜到特写，剑光一闪，慢动作，樱花被剑气激得四散。\n非叙事性音乐：N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [430, 190], "pos": [-1990, 6270], "id": 175, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["| megapixels | Aspect | Output (multiple=32) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n| 1.2 | 16:9 | 1504 x 832 |\n| 1.5 | 16:9 | 1664 x 928 |\n| 1.8 | 16:9 | 1824 x 1024 |\n| 2.0 | 16:9 | 1920 x 1088 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Size Settings Reference", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [300, 520], "pos": [-2360, 5790], "id": 140, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [276], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [277], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["9:16 (Portrait Widescreen)", 0.3, 32], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "type": "